name 'iterating-with-ai-preassessment-q14_2025'

question 'A developer is building an interactive dashboard. What is the first step they should take before writing any code?'

wrong 'Ask an AI to write the entire application.'
right 'Design a wireframe and specify a data schema that supports the planned features.'
wrong 'Pick the colors and fonts for the final product.'
wrong 'Write a `while` loop that prints "Hello World."'

allow_multiple_attempts true

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lesson 11

Planning the visual layout (wireframe) and the data structure (schema) ensures that the code you write later will actually work with the data you have.
MARKDOWN
